    <output type="test">SubmissionOverrideServiceTests.cs; SubmissionOverrideEndpointsAuthorizationContractTests.cs</output>
  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Override returns 403 ebilling.override.not_permitted for a caller without the privilege, and also when the privilege probe fails; seeding proof recorded.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">A privileged override with a reason on a blocked internal submission releases the already-persisted held invoice (D-101) to approval, so it starts counting toward spend (D-102), writes exactly one Decision Record, and the blocking finding is visible on the invoice marked Overridden with who, when and reason.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Override without a reason is 400; on an SPA, Failed or already accepted submission it is 409; a repeat writes nothing new.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">A failure inside the accept path leaves no invoice and the submission still Rejected.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">GET blocked returns canOverride true only for privileged callers; Return behaves per the recorded F-7 answer.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Routes return 401 unauthenticated and 503 ebilling.disabled when off.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">dotnet build 0 errors; all tests green, including OperationAccessPolicyCompletenessTests.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Publish-size delta measured against a fresh master build and recorded in task notes; no new HIGH CVE.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Cover the stated contract plus the edge cases named above. Anything beyond that needs a one-line justification in task notes.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>Parallel group P4-B: own files. Shared append points: FinanceModule.cs, EndpointMappingExtensions.cs, and 049's accept-path file (103 also adds one call there — re-read immediately before editing; /conflict-check before the PR). The only WP4-B task that edits OperationAccessPolicy.cs. If option A is chosen, the marker table and role are created in dev by this task's idempotent script under scripts/ebilling/ and synced to solution source by 112. 052 (wizard) and 111 (page) consume canOverride and these routes.</notes>

